        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    actor Shipper\n    participant App as ShipperApp (Presentation)\n    participant Logic as DeliveryService (Business Logic)\n    participant DB as PackageRepo (Data)\n\n    Shipper-&gt;&gt;App: Chon don hang, bam cap nhat trang thai\n    App-&gt;&gt;Logic: Gui DTO (GPS, TrangThai, COD, Anh...) qua HTTP/gRPC\n    \n    alt Giao hang thanh cong (Happy Path)\n        Logic-&gt;&gt;Logic: Kiem tra GPS, xac thuc tien COD &amp; Anh dinh kam\n        Logic-&gt;&gt;DB: Update Status = &#39;DELIVERED&#39;\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Logic: Tra ve ket qua luu CSDL\n        Logic--&gt;&gt;App: HTTP 200 OK - Giao hang thanh cong\n        App--&gt;&gt;Shipper: Hien thi thong bao \&quot;Giao hang thanh cong\&quot;\n    else Khach vang nha hoac Tu choi (Alternative Flow)\n        Logic-&gt;&gt;Logic: Ghi nhan ly do that bai (FAILED_ATTEMPT_1)\n        Logic-&gt;&gt;DB: Update Status = &#39;FAILED_ATTEMPT_1&#39;\n        Logic-&gt;&gt;DB: Tu dong tao lich giao hang lai lan 2\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Logic: Tra ve ket qua luu CSDL\n        Logic--&gt;&gt;App: HTTP 200 OK - Da luu trang thai that bai\n        App--&gt;&gt;Shipper: Hien thi \&quot;Ghi nhan that bai &amp; Da len lich lai\&quot;\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="_se8yyI0DlH9w5kuS_aK-1">
